From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:58:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1211/3799] soh: rename func_8086ED70 -> BgBombwall_WaitForBomb

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: runs the AC check while the player is within 600 units and, on a hit, sets the switch flag and starts the break.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Bombwall/z_bg_bombwall.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/soh/Network/Anchor/HookHandlers.cpp                 | 4 ++--
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Bombwall/z_bg_bombwall.c | 7 ++++---
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/soh/Network/Anchor/HookHandlers.cpp b/soh/soh/Network/Anchor/HookHandlers.cpp
index 4b0532649..1adc478ea 100644
--- a/soh/soh/Network/Anchor/HookHandlers.cpp
+++ b/soh/soh/Network/Anchor/HookHandlers.cpp
@@ -32,7 +32,7 @@ extern "C" {
